  "description": "A renowned escort and talented painter has spent his life trapped in a cruel cycle of survival. After a drunken one-night stand with a powerful underworld boss, he unexpectedly encounters the man again at a lavish charity gala. The ruthless man offers him an exclusive arrangement worth an extravagant weekly sum, demanding complete devotion in return. Could this dangerous contract finally lead him to the peaceful, ordinary life he's always longed for?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4447000709), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=15029317), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/their_affair), [MrBlue](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498027202), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260884)",
